body_text:
### Summary

Clippy incorrectly formats a function body when removing a redundant unit expression (`()`), leaving behind an empty line.

### Reproducer

Code:

```rust
pub fn foo(x: usize) -> () {
    let _ = x;
    ()
}
```

Current output:

```rust
pub fn foo(x: usize) {
    let _ = x;

}
```

Desired output:

```rust
pub fn foo(x: usize) {
    let _ = x;
}
```


### Version

```text
clippy 0.1.97 (36ba2c7712 2026-04-23)
```

